  "action": "question",
  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "When you say maximize domestic GDP, do you mean the total value of all four domestically produced goods (steel, engines, electronics, plastic) at their world-market prices, or only the value of goods that are actually exported (i.e., produced minus what is consumed as inputs in other production)?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy definition choice between two mutually exclusive interpretations of 'maximize domestic GDP'."
}

