    "is the objective the total value of all four domestically produced goods (steel, engines, electronics, plastic) at their world-market prices, counting each unit of production once regardless of whether it is used as an input in other production or exported?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for confirmation of the objective function definition, including how units are counted."
}

